'''Sector four''' was an area of [[jungle]] on the [[planet]] [[Wayland]]. It was located past the perimeter of [[Tantiss Base]], an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] facility built in [[Mount Tantiss]] on Wayland.<ref name="Confined" /> During or after [[18 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TBBDate|301}}</ref> [[Shuttle 135]] crash landed in sector four during a storm and its crew were [[Death|killed]] by the creatures of the jungle.<ref name="Confined" /> The rogue [[Cloning|clones]] [[Crosshair]] and [[Omega]] later traveled to sector four after escaping Mount Tantiss, encountering a [[dryax]] there as well as [[Imperial Military|Imperial forces]].<ref name="Shadow" />

